      </a>

      <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>

      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#process">How I Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>

      <a class="nav-cta" href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4">Let's Talk</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="eyebrow">Creative Thinking. Professional Design.</div>
          <h1>Building Professional Websites That <span>Grow Your Business.</span></h1>
          <p>
            I help businesses, entrepreneurs and brands establish a powerful
            online presence through modern, attractive and user-friendly
            website designs that make a lasting impression.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button" href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4">Start Your Project ↗</a>
            <a class="button-outline" href="#services">Explore My Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="trust-strip">
      <div class="container trust-content">
        <div class="trust-item"><span>✦</span> Modern Design</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span>✦</span> Mobile-Friendly Websites</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span>✦</span> User-Focused Experience</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span>✦</span> Business-Focused Solutions</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="about-panel">
          <div class="section-label">The Creative Difference</div>
          <h3>Designing Digital Experiences That Matter.</h3>
          <p>Professional presentation. Thoughtful design. Meaningful results.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-copy">
          <div class="section-label">About Richard</div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Your Vision Deserves a Professional Online Presence.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Welcome to Richard Wix Creative. I focus on creating professional
            websites that help businesses communicate their value, build
            credibility and connect with their ideal customers.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you need a business website, a personal portfolio or a
            landing page, my goal is to deliver a clean and engaging digital
            experience that reflects your brand.
          </p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Clean and modern website layouts</li>
            <li>Responsive designs for mobile and desktop</li>
            <li>Clear navigation and user-friendly structure</li>
            <li>Professional presentation of your brand</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4" class="button">Work With Me ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="section-label">What I Do</div>
          <h2>Professional Digital Services</h2>
          <p>
            Practical website solutions designed to help your business
            stand out and make a strong impression online.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">⌘</div>
            <h3>Business Website Design</h3>
            <p>Professional websites that introduce your business, showcase your services and build customer confidence.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">▣</div>
            <h3>Wix Website Design</h3>
            <p>Custom Wix websites with attractive layouts, clear navigation and a polished brand presentation.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">↗</div>
            <h3>Landing Page Design</h3>
            <p>Focused landing pages created to present your offer and encourage visitors to take action.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">✧</div>
            <h3>Portfolio Websites</h3>
            <p>Personal and professional portfolio websites that present your skills, work and experience.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">◎</div>
            <h3>Website Redesign</h3>
            <p>Give an existing website a more modern, organised and professional appearance.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">◇</div>
            <h3>Website Consultation</h3>
            <p>Get guidance on website structure, design direction and the right online presentation for your business.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div class="section-label">My Approach</div>
          <h2>A Simple, Professional Process</h2>
          <p>From your initial idea to the finished website, every project follows a clear process.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-grid">
          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h3>Discovery</h3>
            <p>We discuss your business, goals, audience and website requirements.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h3>Planning & Design</h3>
            <p>I develop a suitable website structure and visual direction for your brand.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h3>Development</h3>
            <p>Your website is built with attention to presentation, usability and responsiveness.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="step-number">04</div>
            <h3>Delivery</h3>
            <p>The completed website is reviewed and prepared for launch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">Let's Create Something Great</div>
        <h2>Ready to Give Your Business a Stronger Online Presence?</h2>
        <p>
          Let's discuss your website idea and turn it into a professional
          digital experience that represents your brand.
        </p>
        <a href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4" class="button">Discuss Your Project on WhatsApp ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="container contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="section-label">Get In Touch</div>
          <h3>Let's Talk About Your Next Website Project.</h3>
          <p>
            Have a business website, portfolio or landing page in mind?
            Reach out and let's discuss how to bring your idea to life.
          </p>
          <p><strong>Richard Wix Creative</strong><br>Professional Website Design & Digital Solutions</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <h3>Start a Conversation</h3>
          <p>Send a message with a brief description of your project. I'll be happy to discuss your requirements.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4" class="button">Chat With Me on WhatsApp ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-content">
      <div><strong>RICHARD WIX CREATIVE</strong><br>Professional Website Design</div>
      <div>© <span id="year"></span> Richard Wix Creative. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <a class="whatsapp-float" href="https://wa.link/hpj0v4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    WhatsApp ↗
  </a>

  <script>
    const menuButton = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
    const navLinks = document.querySelector('.nav-links');

    menuButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const isOpen = navLinks.classList.toggle('active');
      menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen);
      menuButton.textContent = isOpen ? '×' : '☰';
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-links a').forEach(link => {
      link.addEventListener('click', () => {
        navLinks.classList.remove('active');
        menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        menuButton.textContent = '☰';
      });
    });

    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
